=== Mascot ===
The organizing board of the 2019 African Cup of Nations revealed the AFCON 2019 Mascot; "Tut", which was inspired by the Egyptian Pharaoh [[Tutankhamun]]. His kit bears resemblance to [[Egyptian national football team|Egypt]]'s home colors, with the map of [[Africa]] visible on his shirt as well as the tournament's logo.<ref>[https://www.egypttoday.com/Article/8/70587/2019-AFCON-Mascot-revealed "2019 AFCON Mascot revealed"], ''Egypt Today'', 20 May 2019</ref>

=== Match ball ===
[[Umbro]] replaced [[Mitre Sports International|Mitre]] as the Cup of Nations match ball provider and the official match ball for this tournament, named Neo Pro, was unveiled on 29 May 2019.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://football-balls.com/ball-details/caf-umbro-neo-pro-official-match-ball-of-africa-cup-2019-in-egypt |title=CAF Umbro Neo Pro is official match ball of Africa Cup 2019 &#124; Football Balls Database |publisher=Football-balls.com |date= |accessdate=2022-01-19}}</ref>

